       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. calls.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 I     PIC 9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       01 T     PIC 9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 20000000
              CALL "csub" USING I T
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY T
           STOP RUN.
